## Interface: 120100
## Title: BestCraft
## Notes: Adds a button to the Place Crafting Order screen that builds an Auctionator shopping list for the highest quality reagents for a crafting order
## Author: Tharavol, Claude
## Version: @project-version@
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\inv_misc_symbolofkings_01
## X-License: GPL-3.0-or-later
## Dependencies: Auctionator

## X-ReleaseNotes: Adds a button to the customer-side "Place Crafting Order" screen (ProfessionsCustomerOrdersFrame) that reads the highest-quality reagent allocation Blizzard's own "Use Best Quality Reagents" checkbox has already computed for the order, and builds an Auctionator shopping list for exactly what to go buy -- for every order, recraft or not. No independent quality or profit optimization is performed; this only reuses the choice the game has already made. Requires Auctionator. Source and issues: https://github.com/Tharavol/BestCraft

